if(typeof require==='function'){var GameMode=require('./gamemode');var Constants=require('./constants');var RoundModel=require('./roundmodel');var Maze=require('./maze');var ScoreState=require('./scorestate');var BulletWeapon=require('./bulletweapon');var IdGenerator=require('./idgenerator');}var BootCampGameMode=GameMode.subclass();BootCampGameMode.fields({tanks:null,tankCount:0,roundFinishingDuration:0,crateSpawnDuration:0});BootCampGameMode.constructor(function(){this._super();this.mode=Constants.GAME_MODES.BOOT_CAMP;});BootCampGameMode.methods({canRemovePlayer:function(playerId){return this.roundController.getTank(playerId)===undefined;},getScoreStates:function(playerId){var result=[];result.push(ScoreState.withState(IdGenerator.instance.gen('s'),playerId,Constants.SCORE_TYPES.KILL,0));result.push(ScoreState.withState(IdGenerator.instance.gen('s'),playerId,Constants.SCORE_TYPES.VICTORY,0));return result;},initializeRound:function(){this.tanks=this.roundController.getTanks();this.tankCount=Object.keys(this.tanks);this.roundFinishingDuration=Constants.ROUND_FINISHING_DURATION;this.crateSpawnDuration=Constants.CRATE_SPAWN_DURATION_MIN+Math.random()*Constants.CRATE_SPAWN_DURATION_VARIANCE;},getTeam:function(playerId){return Constants.TEAMS.NO_TEAM;},getMaze:function(playerIds,theme){if(this.symmetric){return Maze.createSymmetric(Math.min(Constants.MAZE.MAX_WIDTH,Math.floor((Constants.MAZE.BASE_WIDTH+Constants.MAZE.WIDTH_FOR_PLAYERS[playerIds.length])*(Math.random()*(Constants.MAZE.MAX_RANDOM_WIDTH_MULTIPLIER-1.0)+1.0))),Math.min(Constants.MAZE.MAX_HEIGHT,Math.floor((Constants.MAZE.BASE_HEIGHT+Constants.MAZE.HEIGHT_FOR_PLAYERS[playerIds.length])*(Math.random()*(Constants.MAZE.MAX_RANDOM_HEIGHT_MULTIPLIER-1.0)+1.0))),playerIds,this.ranked?Constants.MAZE_THEMES.STANDARD:theme);}else{return Maze.createRandom(Math.min(Constants.MAZE.MAX_WIDTH,Math.floor((Constants.MAZE.BASE_WIDTH+Constants.MAZE.WIDTH_FOR_PLAYERS[playerIds.length])*(Math.random()*(Constants.MAZE.MAX_RANDOM_WIDTH_MULTIPLIER-1.0)+1.0))),Math.min(Constants.MAZE.MAX_HEIGHT,Math.floor((Constants.MAZE.BASE_HEIGHT+Constants.MAZE.HEIGHT_FOR_PLAYERS[playerIds.length])*(Math.random()*(Constants.MAZE.MAX_RANDOM_HEIGHT_MULTIPLIER-1.0)+1.0))),playerIds,this.ranked?Constants.MAZE_THEMES.STANDARD:theme);}},getInitialWeaponState:function(playerId){return BulletWeapon.createInitialWeaponState(IdGenerator.instance.gen('bw'),playerId,Constants.BULLET_AMMO_COUNT);},getInitialUpgradeState:function(playerId){return null;},getRespawnWeaponState:function(playerId){return this.getInitialWeaponState(playerId);},getRespawnUpgradeState:function(playerId){return this.getInitialUpgradeState(playerId);},roundEventHandler:function(self,id,evt,data){switch(evt){case RoundModel._EVENTS.ROUND_ENDED:{var score=self.gameController.getScoreByPlayerIdAndType(data.getPlayerIds()[0],Constants.SCORE_TYPES.VICTORY);if(score){self.gameController.adjustScore(score.getId(),1);}break;}case RoundModel._EVENTS.TANK_KILLED:{self.roundFinishingDuration=Constants.ROUND_FINISHING_DURATION;if(data.getKillerPlayerId()!=data.getVictimPlayerId()){var score=self.gameController.getScoreByPlayerIdAndType(data.getKillerPlayerId(),Constants.SCORE_TYPES.KILL);if(score){self.gameController.adjustScore(score.getId(),1);}}break;}case RoundModel._EVENTS.TANK_DESTROYED:{self.roundFinishingDuration=Constants.ROUND_FINISHING_DURATION;break;}}},update:function(deltaTime){if(this.crateTypes.length>0){if(this.roundController.getCrateCount()<Constants.MAX_CRATES){this.crateSpawnDuration-=deltaTime;if(this.crateSpawnDuration<0.0){var cratePosition=undefined;if(this.symmetric){cratePosition=this.roundController.getMaze().getCrateSpawnPosition(this.roundController.getRoundState(true));}else{cratePosition=this.roundController.getMaze().getRandomUnusedPosition(this.roundController.getRoundState(true),Constants.CRATE_MINIMUM_TILES_TO_TANKS);}if(cratePosition){var randomCrateType=this.crateTypes[Math.floor(Math.random()*this.crateTypes.length)];this.roundController.spawnCrate(randomCrateType,cratePosition);}this.crateSpawnDuration=Constants.CRATE_SPAWN_DURATION_MIN+Math.random()*Constants.CRATE_SPAWN_DURATION_VARIANCE;}}}this.tanks=this.roundController.getTanks();this.tankCount=Object.keys(this.tanks).length;if(this.tankCount<=1){this.roundFinishingDuration-=deltaTime;}},isRoundOver:function(){return this.roundFinishingDuration<=0;},getWinnerPlayerIds:function(){if(this.tankCount==1){return[this.tanks[Object.keys(this.tanks)[0]].getPlayerId()];}else{return[];}},getVictoryExperience:function(){return 0;},getKillExperience:function(){return 0;},getVictoryGoldAmount:function(){return 0;}});if(typeof module==='object'){module.exports=BootCampGameMode;}